      "message": "fix(site): document the 0.26.0 operations, post hooks and manifest flags\n\nThe release site tests were red on v0.26.0 and main, so the pages job\ndid not deploy. Add the two missing operation icons, a Multi-Axis Deburr\nsection, a Waterjet Profile page with its toolpath pictures, the\nonJetOn/onJetOff hooks and the lineEnding, linearizeArcs and\nuprightReturn manifest rows. The machines page no longer says that no\nwaterjet operation ships.\n\nFixes #3763\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
